# Ship only the static landing page to Vercel.
# The repo root contains heavy native deps (sharp, onnxruntime),
# multi-GB extension/docs folders and node_modules — none of which
# the landing page needs. Ignoring them keeps uploads fast and
# prevents Vercel from running a needless (and failing) install.
*
!Landing_page/
!Landing_page/**
!vercel.json
